### Product Management API - REST Client requests
### Install the "REST Client" (humao.rest-client) extension,
### then click "Send Request" above any block below.

@host = http://localhost:8080

### Hello (sanity check) - note the mapping is "/" not "/h"
GET {{host}}/

### Health check
GET {{host}}/actuator/health

### Create a product
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop",
  "price": 55000.0,
  "quantity": 10
}

### Get all products
GET {{host}}/api/products

### Get one product
GET {{host}}/api/products/1

### Update a product
PUT {{host}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gaming Laptop",
  "price": 75000.0,
  "quantity": 5
}

### Delete a product
DELETE {{host}}/api/products/1

### Validation failure (should return 400)
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -5,
  "quantity": -1
}
